"Component: Spectral Stonecutter": {
  "index": "2",
  "category": "sorcery",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Summon Spectral Stonecutter"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "I can "
        },
        {
          "text": "conjure a phantasmal stonecutter",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " that will allow me to shape stone at it for a short duration, as with a normal stonecutter. \n\nI'm able to effortlessly maintain the stonecutter as long as I or any other person is close to it, But otherwise it will fade after twenty seconds. \n\nAlternately, if I simply cast the component on myself, I can create a small stonecutter that only I can use immediately, and it will dissipate the moment I am done with it."
        },
        {
          "text": "\n\nIf I cast this spell on a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Metal Ritual Rune",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ", the effect will become permanent at that location, until broken manually."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "related_recipes": [
